  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2018-2024 Toyota Camry (Not fit Hybrid or AWD)\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,only for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nFits Like A Glove: Custom-crafted for 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Toyota Camry, these floor mats use cutting-edge 3D laser scanning to hug every curve, delivering unbeatable front-to-back coverage for your ride\nEco-Safe & Built Tough: Our TPE-LITE Camry floor mats withstand daily wear and extreme temperatures—standing strong through icy winters and scorching summers to keep your Camry pristine year after year\nWeatherproof Grip: Keep your car's interior spotless with our Camry floor mats; Deep channels and raised edges trap liquids, mud, and debris, while anti-slip hooks ensure a firm grip, preventing shifting to protect every passenger\nCleanup's a Breeze: Forget bulky vacuums and harsh chemicals; These skid-resistant mats just need a quick shake or a rinse with the hose, and they’re good as new; Always remove old mats before installing new liners for a secure fit\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
